Files, Changes and Tabs implementations, directory-listing code, and file-browser icons
are adapted from Herdr 0.1.13:
https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app

Herdr's source is licensed under Apache License 2.0; see LICENSE-HERDR.
The adapted implementations have been modified to use shared per-tab folder
selection and Pi session metadata, and to combine Files and Changes under one
Files entry with an internal mode toggle and selected-directory branch context. The original browsing, preview, Git diff,
and repository-wide commit behavior is retained.

